OL,5,G2000 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,6,     FMandy, 64, has bled heavily from
OL,7,     Fher nose for over three hours,
OL,8,     Flosing a pint of blood just in the
OL,9,     Fambulance. And Gillian, 76, is
OL,10,     Fbrought in after a fall, covered
OL,11,     Fin blood.
OL,12,G2100 Ambulance: Code Red
OL,13,     FA 52-year-old man complains of
OL,14,     Fneck and shoulder pains after
OL,15,     Fbeing thrown off his motorbike,
OL,16,     Fand a 40-year-old epileptic woman
OL,17,     Fhas collapsed with a dangerously
OL,18,     Flow breathing rate.
