OL,5,G2200 A&E After Dark
OL,6,     FA&E staff tackle night shifts,
OL,7,     Fmanaging severe trauma, violence,
OL,8,     Fand complex cases, including a man
OL,9,     Fwith severed fingers, a farmer
OL,10,     Fwith hand injuries, and a possible
OL,11,     Fheart attack.
OL,12,G2300 Skin A&E
OL,13,     FDr Toby Nelson checks a patient's
OL,14,     Fback and finds a pre-cancerous
OL,15,     Fmole, Dr Emma McMullen inspects a
OL,16,     Flipoma on a patient's buttock, and
OL,17,     FDr Dev Shah treats a collection of
OL,18,     Fskin tags.
