OL,5,G0200 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,6,     FChristine, 71, has a bleeding head
OL,7,     Ffollowing a fall. As she is on
OL,8,     Fblood thinners, a scan is urgently
OL,9,     Fneeded. Dean has necrotising
OL,10,     Ffasciitis, a flesh-eating
OL,11,     Finfection.
OL,12,G0245 Skin A&E
OL,13,     FA butcher from Somerset brings a
OL,14,     Fmeaty lipoma on his neck for Dr
OL,15,     FDev Shah. Dr Toby Nelson has a
OL,16,     Fpatient with a skin condition
OL,17,     Faround her eyes.
OL,18,G0335 Home and Away
OL,19,     FEden's got a surprise in store.
OL,20,     FSonny steps up. Amelia's invited
OL,21,     Fto a Langham lunch.
OL,22,G0400 Teleshopping
